        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-073395-f43e5d90a70bff06",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-073395",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "After identifying a protein of interest, we use our toolbox of integrated capabilities to help accelerate the discovery and development of small molecule medicines, enabling us to study molecular structures and gain a better understanding of the biological mechanisms of proteins.",
        "start_character": 6547,
        "end_character": 6827
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-073395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-073395-f43e5d90a70bff06",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-073395",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In June 2025, we entered into an exclusive option and license agreement with Gilead Sciences to accelerate the development and commercialization of a novel molecular glue degrader (MGD) program targeting cyclin-dependent kinase 2 (CDK2) with broad oncology treatment potential, including in breast cancer and other solid tumors.",
        "start_character": 29784,
        "end_character": 30112
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-073395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-073395-f43e5d90a70bff06",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-073395",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to competitors we face in developing small molecule protein degraders, we will also face competition in the indications we expect to pursue with our STAT6, IRF5, IRAK4 and CDK2 programs.",
        "start_character": 41827,
        "end_character": 42025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-073395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-073395-f43e5d90a70bff06",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-073395",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to patents, we also rely on trade secrets, know-how and continuing technological innovation to develop and maintain our competitive position.",
        "start_character": 43886,
        "end_character": 44039
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-073395",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-073395-f43e5d90a70bff06",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-073395",
